ANDROID MANIFEST PATCH
======================

Open:
android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml

Do NOT replace the complete manifest.
Find the existing .MainActivity <activity> element and make it contain:

<activity
    android:name=".MainActivity"
    android:exported="true"
    android:launchMode="singleTask"
    ...>

Keep all your existing attributes and children.
Inside that SAME activity, add this intent filter:

<intent-filter>
    <action android:name="android.intent.action.SEND" />
    <category android:name="android.intent.category.DEFAULT" />
    <data android:mimeType="text/*" />
</intent-filter>

Do not create a second MainActivity.
